msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Currently, there is a bug in Gradle JaCoCo which requires the `excludes` to "
"be specified in this manner - https://github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/14760. "
" Once this issue is fixed, excludes"
msgstr ""

